  "findings": [
    "Explicit bounded closed-PR GET acquisition covers description, issue comments, reviews and review comments, preserving exact decoded UTF8, text hashes, provider coordinates and reply/review identifiers. Network/text grants precede credentials/network; no source Store, model, execution, comment or service write is acquired.",
    "Typed unsigned packet replay validates content hash, scopes, URLs/queries, page/request/text counters, observation identities, body hashes, coverage and selected/unacquired pulls. Null description is known absence; missing body is protocol refusal. Partial provider coverage stays explicit. Receipt hashes and imported transport labels do not authenticate provider/author or atomic state.",
    "Native source/history composition replays immutable source and distinguishes verified commit history from an explicitly selected source capture. Provider anchors never become source-byte authority. Header-only handoff preview excludes discussion text/diff hunks/authors/titles/commit messages and top-level implementation/initializer bodies, preserves omissions and binds source/capture identities.",
    "Fourteen contract cases include HTTP scope/freshness/permission/budget attacks, rehashed hostile packets, credential-like text/error redaction, exact output boundary, actual owned Git capture/history association, source tamper refusal, CLI default denials and offline digest/handoff composition.",
    "Final local source freeze passes native544/0fail/7ignored across11groups, Python17, TypeScript260/3skip, typecheck, format and all-target Clippy. These selected targets do not rerun or accept the previously recorded federation/maintenance symlink setup failures or whole-platform suite.",
    "All three final native anonymous HTTPS cases pass: own repository empty closed-PR listing; canonical Trail-Code PR623; Rust PR163746 with97 observations (description1, issue_comment35, review25, review_comment36). Raw foreign texts stay in an owned external validation directory and are not published. Final binary hash and metadata-only receipts are preserved.",
    "Development red traces, initial schema/fixture failures and corrected follow-ups remain separate from final unchanged-source validation. No service send, durable exact-payload approval/outcome recovery, live App deployment, full upstream/proprietary brain or whole STATUS/R1-R9 acceptance is certified."
  ],
